# LANDFALL: energy. Wick starts with 3 of 3. Hostile creatures hurt on
# contact (each species its own damage), then a moment of safety. A chop
# heals 3 (she leaves it be when she is well). An energy cell adds one to
# the most she can hold and fills her up, to 7 at most. At 0 the trip is
# over: no lives, no continues.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat nomobs
cheat planet 2
cheat species 3 0 0
cheat spset 3 4 2 0
cheat mob 3 100 80
cheat pos 60 82
hold RIGHT 26
expect hp == 1
expect hits == 1
expect last_hurt == 4
expect inv > 0
# a moment of safety: still touching, no second hit
wait 20
expect hp == 1
hold LEFT 30
# a chop heals 3, as far as her most
cheat drop -1 30 82
hold LEFT 20
expect hp == 3
expect chops == 0
# well: she walks over a chop and leaves it
cheat drop -1 50 82
hold RIGHT 20
expect chops == 1
# an energy cell: one more, and full
cheat hp 1 3
cheat thing 2 0 30 110
cheat pos 30 100
hold DOWN 10
expect hpmax == 4
expect hp == 4
expect cubes_found == 1
expect save_energy == 1
# never more than 7
cheat hp 5 7
cheat thing 2 0 80 110
cheat pos 80 100
hold DOWN 10
expect hpmax == 7
expect hp == 7
expect cubes_found == 2
expect save_energy == 2
# 0: the trip is over
cheat hp 2 7
cheat pos 60 82
hold RIGHT 26
expect hp == 0
expect state == 5
wait 100
expect state == 6
expect save_deaths == 1
expect death_by4 == 1
